  description: "Blink was a nomad. Recently, following a raid led by Coal Cauldron,
    she lost everything but her life. At death\u2019s door, she managed to cross
    the desert. In the ruins of an abandoned city, she found Techs, solar panels,
    T-rays, and allies\u2013everything she needed to heal herself and prepare her
    defense."
